urability":0.0,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":0.0,"_gate_fund_growth":0.0479011509817197,"_gp_fund_growth":true,"_score_fund_growth":47.9,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.0,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":11.1,"_gate_share_shrink":null,"_gp_share_shrink":null,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.0521611736018249,"_gp_sbc_dilution":false,"_score_sbc_dilution":13.1,"_gate_insider_own":0.28276,"_gp_insider_own":true,"_score_insider_own":100.0,"_gate_insider_buying":0.0,"_gp_insider_buying":false,"_score_insider_buying":0.0,"pf":[],"description_full":"BillionToOne, Inc., a precision diagnostics company, quantifies biology to create molecular diagnostics. The company provides molecular counting platform, which is designed to detect and measure DNA molecules at the single-count level to help enhance disease detection. It also offers UNITY Complete, a non-invasive prenatal screen that assesses fetal risk for aneuploidies, recessive conditions, and fetal antigens from a maternal blood draw; Northstar Select, a liquid biopsy test that provides a list of mutations that are present in the tumor and types of mutations detected that include deletions, insertions, and point mutations; and Northstar Response, a methylation-based assay that quantifies the amount of cancer at the single molecule level without requiring a tissue biopsy, enabling real-time monitoring of patient response to therapy with unprecedented precision. BillionToOne, Inc. was incorporated in 2016 and is headquartered in Menlo Park, California.","ceo_bio":"Dr. Oguzhan  Atay Ph.D. | Co-Founder, Chairman & CEO | Age 36 | Compensation: $518,397 (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 713 people. Revenue per employee of $428K ranks in the above the sector median among Healthcare peers. Each employee generates $22K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $22K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 1\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity).","financial_summary":["BillionToOne, Inc. is a mid-cap healthcare business with a $4.3B market cap on $305M of annual revenue.","Returns on capital run at 37% against a 10% cost of capital \u2014 a 27-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat. Gross margins of 68% confirm genuine pricing power.","The business throws off $16M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 5 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 3.30\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 28% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 455% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":4.5455505898493},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (11.1% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $14.4M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"High market volatility with VIX at 36, signaling elevated fear","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Widening credit spreads suggest growing stress in corporate debt markets","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Broad market in a downtrend, trading below its 200-day average","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Multiple macro indicators signal economic contraction","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Patent cliffs, drug-pricing reform, and reimbursement pressure \u2014 a single regulatory change can reset the pricing power that justifies the multiple.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Healthcare peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood","Among the least levered in Healthcare \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 11% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (20.3% return)","Healthcare tends to hold up well as investors rotate into defensive names"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"BLLN SHAREHOLDER INVESTIGATION: SueWallSt Notifies Investors of Potential Securities Claims Involving BillionToOne","source":"prnewswire.com","link":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/blln-shareholder-investigation-suewallst-notifies-investors-of-potential-securities-claims-involving-billiontoone-302945482.html","date":"2026-11-19","timestamp":1795101060.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.077,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["legal"]},{"title":"Top 5 Market Movers on Wednesday, November 18, 2026: TENB, ANGX, RCEL, QLYS Surge While BLLN Declines","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/top-5-market-movers-on-wednesday-november-18-2026-tenb-angx-rcel-qlys-surge-while-blln-declines","date":"2026-11-19","timestamp":1795075140.0,"origin":"